  "description": "This version of the META HT V3 offers a build that is both consistent and reliable:\n• The MARZOCCHI Bomber Z1 fork features a precise chassis with 36mm stanchions and is very easy to use thanks to its air spring and RAIL 2.0 cartridge.\n• The DT SWISS E593 rims are designed for enduro riding. Paired with high-volume 2.5'' tyres, these wheels bring great comfort for hardtail use.\n• The SHIMANO MT420 brakes offer 4 pistons and powerful, consistent braking, with the renowned \"SHIMANO\" feel.\n• The SHIMANO Deore drivetrain was chosen for its reliability, smoothness and gear range, letting you ride anywhere for hours on end.",
